Package: MIMSTEM
Type: Package
Title: Marginal Interventional Multi-State Time-to-Event Mediation
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Nana", "Wang", email = "wnn0924@126.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements three marginal interventional multi-state mediation
    estimators for time-to-event mediators: MIMS-TEM for one time-to-event
    mediator, MIMS-S2TEM-GE for overall effects with two sequential
    time-to-event mediators, and MIMS-S2TEM-PE for path-specific decomposition
    of the overall indirect effect. Individual-level nonparametric bootstrap
    standard errors and Wald confidence intervals are supported.
